Package: czd-icon-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, czd-purple-tokens (= ${binary:Version}), breeze-icon-theme
Description: CZD Purple icon theme (33 glyphs, gold, 1px stroke)
 The freedesktop icon theme for the CZD Purple respin: 33 glyphs on a 24-unit
 grid with a 14-unit live area, 1px gold stroke, inheriting breeze-dark for
 everything it does not define.
